WEBVTT

00:11:29.767 --> 00:11:32.774
Sada se vraćamo na
konja i kočije.

00:11:32.774 --> 00:11:35.095
Želeo bih da dodelim Oskar

00:11:35.095 --> 00:11:38.748
pronalazačima 20. veka,

00:11:38.748 --> 00:11:41.489
ljudima od Aleksandra Grejama Bela

00:11:41.489 --> 00:11:43.192
do Tomasa Edisona,
Braće Rajt.

00:11:43.192 --> 00:11:44.915
Želeo bih da ih pozovem ovde

00:11:44.915 --> 00:11:46.785
i oni će uputiti poziv vama.

00:11:46.785 --> 00:11:50.448
Vaš izazov je:
možete li dostići ono što smo mi postigli?

00:11:50.448 --> 00:11:51.982
Hvala vam.

00:11:51.982 --> 00:11:57.013
(Aplauz)